00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:34.520
it's happening.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.920
So the first thing you need..

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:41.660
is some long piece of cardboard or maybe um,

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.980
like a hockey stick or a piece of wood

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:47.660
or like a couple of paper tower rolls taped together

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:49.980
Just something long that you could tape other things to..

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.480
This was in my garbage.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.800
Next, ideally you would need six Barbie dolls..

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.520
if you have them but if you don't have them that's fine.

00:07:57.760 --> 00:07:59.680
You just need like six dolls.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.700
Or I'm using some dog toys.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:02.960
Just six.

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:03.740
Together.

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:05.160
Get creative!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.020
Basket of dog toys.

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:06.520
3..

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:07.140
4..

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:07.640
5..

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:08.380
6..

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:11.860
And then you need some sort of tape to secure all of them across the board.

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:15.640
But you wanna leave a decent amount of space in the middle.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:16.400
So three on each side.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:17.880
I'm using duct tape.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.680
*festive iMovie music*

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.700
